I see the issue - my battery shows 0 MWh stored, so I cannot discharge. The error confirms I have no stored energy to sell. Given this constraint, I must choose between `charge` or `hold`. Since I have no stored energy and cannot capture any value by discharging, the prudent action is to **hold** and preserve my position for future blocks where I might be able to acquire stored energy.

```json
{
  "action": "hold"
}
```
